sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant Cam as Camera
  participant W as VLM worker
  participant V as VLM server
  participant L as Control loop (20 Hz)
  participant P as PX4
  Note over L,P: take-off, OFFBOARD
  loop every 50 ms
    P->>L: position, velocity, attitude
    Cam->>L: newest depth image + time stamp
    L->>L: search / steer → velocity, depth guard (fresh? frozen? corridor free?)
    L->>P: body velocity setpoint
  end
  L-->>W: release (search holds still)
  Cam->>W: RGB picture taken after the turn + pose
  W->>V: picture (896 px) + instruction
  Note over W,V: 0.6 s (GPU) to 50 s (laptop CPU)
  V-->>W: {"found": true, "box": [...]}
  W->>W: box at image edge: no goal, otherwise median depth → 3-D goal
  W-->>L: goal candidate / "not found"
  L->>L: consensus (2 of 3) → accepted goal, or next view
  Note over L,P: fly to goal, arrive, land
